      "priority": "SECONDARY",
      "reason": "The direction labels do not survive independent blinded verification: exact-label agreement 13 of 42 signal rows, and a maintained-or-raised direction is supported on only 16 of 42. JEV answered raised on 30 signal rows with independent agreement on 8, and maintained on 12 with agreement on 5. The reviewer is a fresh instance of the same model family while the instrument is a separate TypeSafe System One model; neither read is ground truth and the disqualifying fact is the instability itself."
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "priority": "TERTIARY",
      "reason": "Market-data coverage at the frozen +21 primary cell is below the frozen floor: INTACT_FORWARD has 19 events with at least 2 control dates and 11 issuer clusters against a floor of 20 matched events."
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "priority": "FOURTH",
      "reason": "The frozen rule had almost no arithmetic corroboration: 5 filings produced a comparable numeric pair and the deterministic numeric path never fired (0 filings with a numeric direction source), so direction rested on one uncorroborated answer per filing."
    }
